## Decision

Adopt the meta-architecture in `META-ARCHITECTURE.md` (spec v{SPEC_VERSION}) at
**{STAGE}**. Live from day one:

- Cross-module types only in `interfaces/` — additive-only, `extra="ignore"`, nested shapes
  typed as models (§3), machine-checked by `tools/check_additivity.py` (§8.1).
- The §4 ontology, machine-checked by `tools/check_boundaries.py` (§8.1): modules meet only
  on the bus; neutral packages stay pure; the contract imports nothing internal.
- `schema_version` on every envelope (§8.5); semantics never mutate (§8.6).
- Capability discovery as an in-process registry lookup (§5).
- Dual versioning per module: `VERSION` (release) + `__version__` (inward contract) (§4).

Deliberately deferred until a §10 trigger fires: {DEFERRED_LIST — STAGE0: submodules, the
superproject, per-service tagging, promote.sh, the deploy repo, a real broker, a second
transport | STAGE1: the deploy repo until two services run together, a second transport}.
Each graduation lever may be pulled alone, behind one seam, with its own ADR (§10).

